<title>UK: TABLE - Bodycote yr profits surge 48 percent.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Bodycote yr profits surge 48 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 29.5		  vs 20.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   4.8		  vs  N/A</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   7.4		  vs  6.1</p>
<p> Pretax preexcepts	 27.20		 vs 18.44</p>
<p> Pretax profits	    27.64		 vs 18.94</p>
<p> Turnover		   120.01		 vs 80.39</p>
<p>NOTE - Earnings per share is headline figure based on the weighted average number of shares during the year. Ordinary earnings per share were 30.2 pence vs 19.7 pence. Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 24.5 and 26.7 million stg.</p>
<p>Full name of British engineering services company - Bodycote International Plc.</p>
